# Purpose
# Create a transfer zip with source files needed to rebuild the project.
#
# Common usage
# Run from the repository root.
# .\scripts\package-source.ps1
# .\scripts\package-source.ps1 -ArchiveName handoff.zip -Force
# .\scripts\package-source.ps1 -OutputDirectory source-packages -ArchiveName site-source.zip
# .\scripts\package-source.ps1 -ListOnly
#
# Useful options
# -OutputDirectory chooses where the zip is written.
# -ArchiveName chooses the zip file name.
# -Force overwrites an existing zip with the same name.
# -IncludeArchiveAssets includes archive support assets when needed.
# -ListOnly prints included files without creating a zip.
#
# Recommended next command
# .\scripts\package-source.ps1 -ListOnly
#
# Notes
# Build outputs and fetched packages are excluded.
# The default output folder is source-packages.
